MICB Mobile Banking is meant for BC "Moldindconbank" S.A. clients (individuals only) and provides the following features:
•	Authentication by quick Access code and biometrics (TouchID, FaceID);
•	Visualization of account balances;
•	Setup and visualization of transactional card limits;
•	Visualization of transactional history and related details;
•	Visualization of Bank details used for local and international incoming transfer;
•	Visualization of income and spending statistics related to card transactions;
•	P2P transfers between own cards and to foreign cards;
•	Quick P2P transfers by phone number (P2P by Phone / Send to Friend);
•	Card security Lock / Unlock;
•	Card protection service – "Transactional Window";
•	One time password generation (Mobile OTP) meant for eCommerce transactions confirmation and "MICB Web Banking" operations confirmation as well;
•	Code generation for quick cash retrieval (Cash by Code) and cash deposit (Mobile Cash) operated at ATM;
•	Billing payments (over 700 service providers);
•	Quick access to ATM geolocation information;
•	PIN change;
•	View card number;
•	"MIA" instant payments;

User guide: http://www.micb.md/img/smartbanking/intructiune-utilizare-mb-en.pdf

Discover financial freedom with maibank – maib’s app that makes banking simple and easy, with an entire bank on your smartphone. 

With maibank you get:
• simple, safe and intuitive experience;
• high-level security, implementing the most advanced encryption and authentication technologies, including biometrics;
• easy account management;
• flexible loans and deposits;
• digital cards and fast payments.

Maibank offers a convenient and innovative banking experience, and the app's functionality constantly improves.
To benefit from the advantages of maibank, you need to install the app and have an account/card opened at maib.

The "eCredit" mobile application offers the possibility to customers to manage current loans obtained from O.C.N. "Easy Credit" S.R.L and request a new credit from distance with the help of mobile phone without spending more time. In order to access the application enter your IDNP and password obtained by email or SMS. 

The main features of the eCredit application: 
- Secure access to information on credits contracted within O.C.N. “Easy Credit” S.R.L.;
- Possibility of payment of monthly instalment or integral credit by the bank card in the 24/7 regime;
- Setting of interaction language in the course of a session in the eCredit application;
- Sending of important notifications for client;
- Possibility of submission of credit application remotely on advantageous terms;
- View of location of secondary offices and partners through the interactive map.

In order to benefit from the access to the еCredit application, it is necessary to have an active or paid credit within O.C.N. “Easy Credit” S.R.L.

Thank you for your choice.

Aplicația mobilă pentru iOS de la FinComBank va permite gestiunea cardurilor și conturilor DVS ușor, sigur și rapid!

Avantaje:
	•	Mobilitate și simplitate în utilizare
	•	Securitatea datelor
	•	Gestiunea conturilor/cardurilor online si a produselor bancare

Ce operațiuni pot efectua:
	•	Vizualizarea soldurilor și  extraselor de carduri/conturi;
	•	Vizualizarea rechizitelor conturilor/cardurilor;
	•	Achitarea serviciilor comunale/ comerciale;
	•	Efectuarea transferurilor P2P pe cardurile Visa și MasterCard;
	•	Efectuarea transferurilor între conturi FinComBank;
	•	Efectuarea transferurilor pe conturi deschise în alte bănci;
	•	Recepționarea transferurilor rapide online;
	•	Alimentarea depozitului;
	•	Achitarea creditului;
	•	Geolocația bancomatelor și subdiviziunilor Băncii;
	•	Vizualizarea cursului valutar.

Pentru accesarea aplicației, este necesar să aveți acces la serviciul FinComPay internet-banking.

Dacă nu beneficiați de serviciul FinComPay internet-banking, Vă puteți înregistra online pe site https://fiz3.fincompay.com/GAMA/web/main_dev.php/login-remote sau în orice sucursală FinComBank.

Notă: Aplicația este disponibilă doar pentru persoanei fizice, clienți FinComBank.

Acum poti sa transferi bani în cel mai simplu mod în care ai făcut-o vreodată …cu telefonul! 

Inregistreaza-te in aplicatia BT Pay, lansata de Banca Transilvania, completand urmatoarele informatii: numarul de telefon, data nasterii si detaliile cardurilor BT pe care le doresti sa fie incluse in aplicatie, in format digital.


Ce poti face cu aplicatia BT Pay? Multe:

• Trimiti bani catre cine doresti sau poti solicita sa ti se trimita bani cand ai nevoie. Tot ce trebuie sa stii pentru transfer este numarul de telefon al persoanei catre care/de la care este transferul de bani;
• Poti transfera bani intre conturile cardurilor tale BT; 
• Poti vedea istoricul tranzactiilor cardurilor cuprinse in BT Pay si cati bani mai ai pe cardul BT. Daca ai si card de credit BT, poti afla inclusiv sumele lunare de plata si cate puncte de loialitate STAR ai acumulate, pentru a le folosi ulterior la alte cumparaturi. Totul, in timp real;
• Primesti in exclusivitate oferte ale partenerilor STAR si ale BT;
• BT Pay integreaza HealthKit pentru a-ti oferi oferte personalizate in functie de numarul de pasi facuti, dar numai daca tu oferi acces acestei functionalitati.

Bucura-te de experienta BT Pay!

